# Local sweep artifacts. Each run writes <runId>.csv + <runId>.meta.json
# here; they're per-developer dev outputs, not source. The historical
# rmom5mxo6-* run from 2026-05-22 is the only run intentionally committed
# (it predates this gitignore and stays as a known-good reference).
#
# Tracked files (do not gitignore):
#   - rmom5mxo6-4cc2b5.csv         (Tuesday harness smoke from 2026-05-22)
#   - rmom5mxo6-4cc2b5.meta.json   (matching meta sidecar)
#   - helpbaseline-mqmjkzq5-09f9ad.json
#       Frozen helpfulness run (2026-06-20). The insight-calibration invariant
#       test (deriveInsightFen.test.ts) iterates committed helpbaseline-*.json
#       runs to assert every surviving insight's movePlayedSan is legal from its
#       derived fen — so CI needs at least this one present.
#
# Everything else (per-developer help/rel baseline JSONs) is local-only.
*.csv
*.meta.json
helpbaseline-*.json
relbaseline-*.json
!rmom5mxo6-4cc2b5.csv
!rmom5mxo6-4cc2b5.meta.json
!helpbaseline-mqmjkzq5-09f9ad.json
